    {
      "exercise": "856",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "a) 两边除以 2，得 $x^2-\\frac92x+5=0$。移项并补入 $\\frac{81}{16}$，得 $\\left(x-\\frac94\\right)^2=\\frac1{16}$，所以 $x-\\frac94=\\pm\\frac14$，解为 $x=2,\\frac52$。代回原式：$2\\cdot2^2-9\\cdot2+10=0$；$2\\cdot\\frac{25}{4}-9\\cdot\\frac52+10=0$。\n\nb) 两边除以 5，得 $x^2+\\frac35x-\\frac85=0$。移项并补入 $\\frac9{100}$，得 $\\left(x+\\frac3{10}\\right)^2=\\frac{169}{100}$，所以 $x+\\frac3{10}=\\pm\\frac{13}{10}$，解为 $x=-\\frac85,1$。代回原式：$5\\cdot\\frac{64}{25}+3\\cdot\\left(-\\frac85\\right)-8=0$；$5+3-8=0$。",
      "tasks": [
        {
          "label": "a)",
          "kind": "completing-square",
          "variable": "x",
          "coefficients": [2, -9, 10],
          "normalizationDivisor": 2,
          "squareShift": "-9/4",
